<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/20/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Dangerous Drugs Act 1952 [Act 234], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 31a by inserting after subsection (1a) the following subsection: “(1aa) Any biological sample collected for the purposes of an examination under this section may be analysed by a science officer employed by the Government.”. Renumbering of section 37a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/20/eng@> .
