<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/20/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by renumbering the existing section 37a as section 37b. New section 37a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/20/eng@> .
